{"id":"34c430417768f1a0","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer.md","title":"Theorem — 单子代数的典范自由余等化表示","display":"Theorem — 单子代数的典范自由余等化表示","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer","aliases":["14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer"],"display":"Theorem — 单子代数的典范自由余等化表示","source_ref":"IV.4 Theorem 2(ii), printed 179–180; DjVu 95–96","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-monad]]","[[14-df-monad-algebras]]","[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]","[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 单子代数的典范自由余等化表示"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.4 Theorem 2(ii), printed 179–180; DjVu 95–96"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61a5bbf642ba9c20\" href=\"?note=61a5bbf642ba9c20\" title=\"14-df-monad\">14-df-monad</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"733785fa2bb6eb61\" href=\"?note=733785fa2bb6eb61\" title=\"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction\">14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f4ff76187675015\" href=\"?note=0f4ff76187675015\" title=\"14-df-split-coequalizer\">14-df-split-coequalizer</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\eta,\\mu)\">\\((T,\\eta,\\mu)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上单子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(A,a)\">\\(K=(A,a)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 代数。使用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"733785fa2bb6eb61\" href=\"?note=733785fa2bb6eb61\" title=\"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction\">14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction</a>的自由函子和<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a>的带标签箭头。余等化、反身对及分裂余等化的参数顺序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0f4ff76187675015\" href=\"?note=0f4ff76187675015\" title=\"14-df-split-coequalizer\">14-df-split-coequalizer</a>；这里的分裂数据在底层范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 中，不预设它们都是代数态射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_K\\coloneqq(F_T(TA),F_T(A),\\mu_A),\\qquad\nr_K\\coloneqq(F_T(TA),F_T(A),T(a)),\\qquad\nv_K\\coloneqq(F_T(A),K,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_K\\coloneqq(F_T(TA),F_T(A),\\mu_A),\\qquad\nr_K\\coloneqq(F_T(TA),F_T(A),T(a)),\\qquad\nv_K\\coloneqq(F_T(A),K,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_K,r_K\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(TA),F_T(A)),\\qquad\nv_K\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A),K),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal C^T}(p_K,r_K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_K,r_K\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(TA),F_T(A)),\\qquad\nv_K\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A),K),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal C^T}(p_K,r_K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal C}(a,\\mu_A,T(a),\\eta_A,\\eta_{TA}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal C^T}(v_K,p_K,r_K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal C}(a,\\mu_A,T(a),\\eta_A,\\eta_{TA}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal C^T}(v_K,p_K,r_K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem2(ii) 的比较图上行使用每个代数的底层分裂余等化图；本条补出分裂见证，并证明带代数结构的余等化普遍性质。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_A\">\\(\\mu_A\\)</span> 从自由代数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_T(TA)\">\\(F_T(TA)\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_T(A)\">\\(F_T(A)\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"733785fa2bb6eb61\" href=\"?note=733785fa2bb6eb61\" title=\"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction\">14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction</a>余单位在自由代数上的底层箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(a)\">\\(T(a)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_T(a)\">\\(F_T(a)\\)</span> 的底层箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 满足代数律，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_K\">\\(v_K\\)</span> 是代数态射。两箭头的共同截面为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_T(\\eta_A)\">\\(F_T(\\eta_A)\\)</span>：底层分别给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1\">\\(\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(a\\eta_A)=1\">\\(T(a\\eta_A)=1\\)</span>，故该对反身。</p>\n<p>底层分裂四式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\mu_A=aT(a)\">\\(a\\mu_A=aT(a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\eta_A=1_A\">\\(a\\eta_A=1_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=1_{TA}\">\\(\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=1_{TA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(a)\\eta_{TA}=\\eta_Aa\">\\(T(a)\\eta_{TA}=\\eta_Aa\\)</span>；最后一式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 的自然性。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0f4ff76187675015\" href=\"?note=0f4ff76187675015\" title=\"14-df-split-coequalizer\">14-df-split-coequalizer</a>于是给出底层余等化。</p>\n<p>对代数箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=(F_T(A),(B,b),u)\">\\(h=(F_T(A),(B,b),u)\\)</span>，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h p_K=h r_K\">\\(h p_K=h r_K\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\mu_A=uT(a)\">\\(u\\mu_A=uT(a)\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=u\\eta_A:A\\to B\">\\(w=u\\eta_A:A\\to B\\)</span>。则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wa=u\\eta_Aa=uT(a)\\eta_{TA}=u\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=u\">\\(wa=u\\eta_Aa=uT(a)\\eta_{TA}=u\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=u\\)</span>。\n又因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 为代数箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bT(u)=u\\mu_A\">\\(bT(u)=u\\mu_A\\)</span>，所以\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bT(w)=bT(u)T(\\eta_A)=u\\mu_AT(\\eta_A)=u=wa\">\\(bT(w)=bT(u)T(\\eta_A)=u\\mu_AT(\\eta_A)=u=wa\\)</span>。\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K,(B,b),w)\">\\((K,(B,b),w)\\)</span> 是所需代数因子。任何其它因子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w&#39;\">\\(w&#39;\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w&#39;a=u\">\\(w&#39;a=u\\)</span>，预合成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_A\">\\(\\eta_A\\)</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w&#39;=u\\eta_A=w\">\\(w&#39;=u\\eta_A=w\\)</span>。这证明代数范畴的余等化，而不要求环境范畴存在一般余等化子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-monad","status":"resolved","id":"61a5bbf642ba9c20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monad]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad-algebras","status":"resolved","id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monad-algebras]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"733785fa2bb6eb61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-split-coequalizer","status":"resolved","id":"0f4ff76187675015","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"733785fa2bb6eb61","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上单子，$K=(A,a)$ 为 $T$ 代数。使用[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]的自由函子和[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的带标签箭头。余等化、反身对及分裂余等化的参数顺序见 [[14-df-split-coequalizer]]；这里的分裂数据在底层范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中，不预设它们都是代数态射。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad-algebras","status":"resolved","id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上单子，$K=(A,a)$ 为 $T$ 代数。使用[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]的自由函子和[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的带标签箭头。余等化、反身对及分裂余等化的参数顺序见 [[14-df-split-coequalizer]]；这里的分裂数据在底层范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中，不预设它们都是代数态射。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-split-coequalizer","status":"resolved","id":"0f4ff76187675015","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上单子，$K=(A,a)$ 为 $T$ 代数。使用[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]的自由函子和[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的带标签箭头。余等化、反身对及分裂余等化的参数顺序见 [[14-df-split-coequalizer]]；这里的分裂数据在底层范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中，不预设它们都是代数态射。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"733785fa2bb6eb61","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mu_A$ 从自由代数 $F_T(TA)$ 到 $F_T(A)$ 是[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]余单位在自由代数上的底层箭头；$T(a)$ 是 $F_T(a)$ 的底层箭头。$a$ 满足代数律，故 $v_K$ 是代数态射。两箭头的共同截面为 $F_T(\\eta_A)$：底层分别给 $\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1$ 和 $T(a\\eta_A)=1$，故该对反身。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-split-coequalizer","status":"resolved","id":"0f4ff76187675015","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"底层分裂四式为 $a\\mu_A=aT(a)$、$a\\eta_A=1_A$、$\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=1_{TA}$、$T(a)\\eta_{TA}=\\eta_Aa$；最后一式是 $\\eta$ 的自然性。[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]于是给出底层余等化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(T,\\eta,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"K=(A,a)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"p_K\\coloneqq(F_T(TA),F_T(A),\\mu_A),\\qquad\nr_K\\coloneqq(F_T(TA),F_T(A),T(a)),\\qquad\nv_K\\coloneqq(F_T(A),K,a).","display":true},{"tex":"p_K,r_K\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(TA),F_T(A)),\\qquad\nv_K\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A),K),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal C^T}(p_K,r_K).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal C}(a,\\mu_A,T(a),\\eta_A,\\eta_{TA}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal C^T}(v_K,p_K,r_K).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_A","display":false},{"tex":"F_T(TA)","display":false},{"tex":"F_T(A)","display":false},{"tex":"T(a)","display":false},{"tex":"F_T(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"v_K","display":false},{"tex":"F_T(\\eta_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1","display":false},{"tex":"T(a\\eta_A)=1","display":false},{"tex":"a\\mu_A=aT(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\eta_A=1_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=1_{TA}","display":false},{"tex":"T(a)\\eta_{TA}=\\eta_Aa","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"h=(F_T(A),(B,b),u)","display":false},{"tex":"h p_K=h r_K","display":false},{"tex":"u\\mu_A=uT(a)","display":false},{"tex":"w=u\\eta_A:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"wa=u\\eta_Aa=uT(a)\\eta_{TA}=u\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=u","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"bT(u)=u\\mu_A","display":false},{"tex":"bT(w)=bT(u)T(\\eta_A)=u\\mu_AT(\\eta_A)=u=wa","display":false},{"tex":"(K,(B,b),w)","display":false},{"tex":"w'","display":false},{"tex":"w'a=u","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_A","display":false},{"tex":"w'=u\\eta_A=w","display":false}],"bytes":2699,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer|Theorem — 单子代数的典范自由余等化表示]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]"},{"id":"a847472bc37dd64a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer|Theorem — 单子代数的典范自由余等化表示]]"},{"id":"b6affdb837eb529f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f1b3afad9b25fc1d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定代数 $K=(A,a)$。[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]定义 $q_K$ 为 $\\varepsilon_{FA},F(a)$ 的余等化，该对反身。保余等化假设使 $Gq_K:TA\\to GL_K$ 余等化 $\\mu_A,T(a)$。另一方面[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]与[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]证明 $a:TA\\to A$ 是同一对的分裂余等化。由两个余等化的泛性质，存在唯一互逆箭头 $i:A\\to GL_K$、$j:GL_K\\to A$ 满足 $ia=Gq_K$、$jGq_K=a$；两复合为恒等，因为余等化箭头右可消去。"},{"id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮已将此路线使用的自由/遗忘伴随、比较函子、分裂余等化子和强 Beck 充分判据展开为 [[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]、[[14-df-monadic-adjunction]]、[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]、[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]、[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]、[[14-thm-beck-monadicity]]。它们为该证明提供具体的单子工具；本条仍未展开 IV.5 幂对象反变函子的单子性与其所需余等化保持验证，不能仅凭新增的一般判据就宣称这条有限余极限证明已经完整重建。此段为证明路线导航，Assertion与直接定义依赖未变。"}],"outgoing":["61a5bbf642ba9c20","e28e85ec3a8dde78","733785fa2bb6eb61","0f4ff76187675015"]}